      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t allow warnings in Soong, they clutter the build and nobody looks at them.\n\nIf you want to requrie the first source file be non-generated I\u0027d suggest:\n\n    if len(srcs) \u003c 1 {\n        ctx.PropertyErrorf(\"srcs\", \"srcs must contain at least one path for a rust file\")\n    }\n\n    if android.SrcIsModule(srcs[0]) !\u003d \"\" {\n        ctx.PropertyErrorf(\"srcs\", \"first element in srcs must be a rust file in the source tree\")\n    }\n\n    allSrcs :\u003d android.PathsForModuleSrc(ctx, srcs)\n    return allSrcs[0], allSrcs\n\nNote that forbidding a module reference as the first element also precludes using a filegroup as the main file, filegroups and genrules are handled the same way.\n\nIf you want to take the first source file of the first entry:\n\n    allSrcs :\u003d android.PathsForModuleSrc(ctx, srcs)\n    if len(allSrcs) \u003c 1 {\n        ctx.PropertyErrorf(\"srcs\", \"srcs must contain at least one path for a rust file\")\n    }\n\n    return allSrcs[0], allSrcs",
